  DisplayName: Customs Auctions Seized Goods
  EventType: 1
  Description: The customs house {is auctioning|will auction} a year of seized contraband
    from the Levant trade. Daggers, jewellery and bales of carpet {are going|will
    go} for whatever the room will bid, and few dealers {know|will know} quite what
    they are buying.
